{"id": 23875, "group": "juspay-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-09T10:06:25.094212+00:00", "text": "you are given a undirected weighted graph having n nodes. and you are given three nodes a, b, and enemy node. enemy node is the starting node of the enemy, and a is your starting point and b is the target node where you want to reach.", "author_tag": "IITG", "reply_to": {"id": 23148, "text": "what question iitb got can you tell pls", "author_tag": "IITG"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
{"id": 23876, "group": "juspay-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-09T10:07:12.359899+00:00", "text": "you have to reach the b nodes safely\nBy safely, it means to reach node b such that the path from a to b has no node such that enemy reaches there before you.", "author_tag": "IITG", "reply_to": {"id": 23875, "text": "you are given a undirected weighted graph having n nodes. and you are given three nodes a, b, and enemy node. enemy node is the starting node of the enemy, and a is your starting point and b is the target node where you want to reach.", "author_tag": "IITG"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
